                            <span class="text-[#111318] text-[11px] font-bold font-sans uppercase tracking-wider">Gündem</span>
                            <span class="text-gray-300 text-[10px]">•</span>
                            <span class="text-[#616f89] text-[11px] font-sans font-medium uppercase tracking-wide">
